40
00:03:53,812 --> 00:03:55,900
[Host] It means to live somewhere.

41
00:03:56,500 --> 00:04:04,467
[Slow] 大分県のすだちや大根おろしも、いっしょに食べることができます。

42
00:04:05,268 --> 00:04:11,364
[Host] People can also eat it together with a small green citrus from Oita and grated white radish.

43
00:04:11,963 --> 00:04:14,219
