44
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:16,492
[Host] It means together.

45
00:04:17,091 --> 00:04:25,827
[Slow] この祭りは、落語の「目黒のさんま」という話から始まりました。

46
00:04:26,627 --> 00:04:32,315
[Host] This festival started from a classic comic story called The Pacific Saury of Meguro.

47
